json-viewer.workedExample:
Input: {"store": {"open": true, "books": [{"title": "The Guide", "price": 299}]}}

1. Load: the tree shows store as Object {2}, books as Array(1).
2. Expand store, then books, then [0]: title and price appear as editable leaves.
3. Edit: click Edit on price, type 249, save -> the value updates in place.
4. Delete: click × on open -> the key disappears, JSON stays valid.
5. Copy updated JSON:
{
  "store": {
    "books": [
      { "title": "The Guide", "price": 249 }
    ]
  }
}
